WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.591
- Rudy Giuliani is suspended

00:00:01.591 --> 00:00:04.310
from the practice of law indefinitely.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.490
He hasn't been disbarred yet,

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.500
but that may be coming.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.900
The New York Bar has found
that Rudy Giuliani has violated

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.590
many of his ethical
obligations as a lawyer,

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.040
especially with respect to being truthful

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.810
and honest in front of tribunals.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.857
They have found that there
is incontrovertible evidence

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:20.688
that he in fact lied

00:00:20.688 --> 00:00:23.790
to countless numbers of
courts and individuals

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.120
with respect to the 2020 election.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.330
As we've talked about
a lot on this channel,

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.610
lawyers have to be truthful.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.380
They cannot lie in furtherance
of their client's aims.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.910
And the New York courts
found that Rudy lied

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.568
with respect to mail-in
ballots in Pennsylvania

00:00:34.568 --> 00:00:36.360
and lied about a lot of the things

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.750
that were happening in Georgia.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.810
Rudy argued that this violates
his First Amendment rights,

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.643
but that generally doesn't work

00:00:40.643 --> 00:00:42.390
when you're talking
about ethical violations

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:43.360
with respect to a profession.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.230
In this case, the profession
of practicing law.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.340
This is of course is highly unusual,

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.510
but the magnitude of the
lies that Rudy was telling

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.180
in front of lots of different courts

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.130
is also extremely unusual.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.360
So he is suspended indefinitely,

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.670
pending further investigation.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.700
So we will definitely see Rudy in court

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.000
to see if he is disbarred.

